From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:23:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] ipa: simple: Add an IMX563 tuning file with autofocus

The IMX563 on the Galaxy Z Flip3 sits behind an AK7377 focus
actuator. Use the uncalibrated algorithms plus Af.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 src/ipa/simple/data/imx563.yaml | 13 +++++++++++++
 src/ipa/simple/data/meson.build |  1 +
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/ipa/simple/data/imx563.yaml

diff --git a/src/ipa/simple/data/imx563.yaml b/src/ipa/simple/data/imx563.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..31d6fb3e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/ipa/simple/data/imx563.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
+%YAML 1.1
+---
+# Sony IMX563 behind an AK7377 focus actuator (Samsung Galaxy Z Flip3 rear
+# wide camera). No calibration yet: uncalibrated.yaml with autofocus on.
+version: 1
+algorithms:
+  - BlackLevel:
+  - Af:
+  - Awb:
+  - Adjust:
+  - Agc:
+...
diff --git a/src/ipa/simple/data/meson.build b/src/ipa/simple/data/meson.build
index 92795ee4..de37046d 100644
--- a/src/ipa/simple/data/meson.build
+++ b/src/ipa/simple/data/meson.build
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0
 
 conf_files = files([
+    'imx563.yaml',
     'uncalibrated.yaml',
 ])
 
